        },
        "notes": "Parking is about 1,000 ISK, paid at the machine and enforced by plate camera. The path behind the falls is closed in ice and you will get soaked when it is open. Then walk 500 m north to Gljúfrabúi — it is a waterfall inside a slot canyon, it is free, you wade the last few metres, and nine coach parties out of ten never see it.",
