        "notes": "Read the warning-light board at the car park before you walk down; it is a real forecast, not decoration. Sneaker waves here kill visitors most years. Stay above the wet line on the sand, never turn your back on the sea, and do not go near the water to take a photograph of someone standing near the water.",
